#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:5
#: f0da227240de44a6b36d3fd714fc3d2f
msgid "ArduPilot Developer Code of Conduct"
msgstr "ArduPilot 开发者行为准则"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:6
#: 6e73d32bf04e4ed5b4b099c752fe8222
msgid "Rev 1.0 Jan 2nd 2018"
msgstr "修订版 1.0，2018 年 1 月 2 日"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:9
#: 4d1e226dd1404ed4b04486bc0f791528
msgid "Our Aim"
msgstr "我们的目标"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:11
#: 5f9d1789b03c4749906601647fb87e63
msgid ""
"ArduPilot aims to enable the creation and use of trusted, autonomous, "
"unmanned vehicle systems for the peaceful benefit of all."
msgstr "ArduPilot 致力于推动可信、自主无人飞行器系统的创建与使用，造福全人类和平事业。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:14
#: 442bf96c5e8549ee94124245e9446ab2
msgid "Our Team"
msgstr "我们的团队"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:16
#: 37e1053fa4ad4ffa92c20ce7fcd18a8e
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot team is global.  It consists of the Development Team plus many"
" contributors, from many fields and many places.  By choosing to be part of "
"the ArduPilot Development Team, you choose to accept this Code of Conduct."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 团队遍布全球，由开发团队及来自各领域、各地区的众多贡献者组成。选择加入 ArduPilot 开发团队，即表示您同意接受本行为准则。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:19
#: e8f7d7ade2ec4151a891a7228e50ff56
msgid "Our Pledge"
msgstr "我们的承诺"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:21
#: 905113232768477fae280c0d2e47c091
msgid ""
"In the interest of fostering an open and welcoming environment, we as "
"developers and maintainers pledge to:"
msgstr "为营造开放友好的环境，我们作为开发者和维护者承诺："

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:23
#: 57ab6fe888ac408db92ed4c3744094b9
msgid ""
"Endeavour to make participation in our project and our community a "
"harassment-free experience for everyone, regardless of age, body size, "
"disability, ethnicity, gender identity and expression, level of experience, "
"nationality, personal appearance, race, religion, or sexual identity and "
"orientation."
msgstr ""
"努力使每位参与者在我们的项目和社区中都能享有无骚扰的体验，无论其年龄、体型、残障状况、民族、性别认同与表达、经验水平、国籍、外貌、种族、宗教信仰或性取向如何。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:24
#: 2afcb8c1638f4fe6a5db0e0f81f5d593
msgid ""
"Endeavour to understand the intent of development activities they undertake,"
" where there may be reason to think that the vehicle may be used as a weapon"
" or in an application where it is effectively in control of human life."
msgstr "当有理由认为飞行器可能被用作武器或有效控制人类生命的应用场景时，努力了解所从事开发活动的意图。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:25
#: a7280826c2a54c72959974b261da8346
msgid ""
"Not knowingly support or facilitate the weaponization of systems using "
"ArduPilot"
msgstr "不故意支持或协助将 ArduPilot 系统武器化"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:26
#: d4710b0949f349a794f4b3ec9f4826d2
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is NOT certified for use in applications where ArduPilot is "
"effectively in control of human lives. Members of the development team must "
"not knowingly assist in projects where ArduPilot will be in control of human"
" lives.  “In control of human lives” includes but isn’t limited to manned "
"aircraft."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 未获得在有效控制人类生命的应用场景中使用的认证。开发团队成员不得故意参与 ArduPilot "
"将控制人类生命的项目。「控制人类生命」包括但不限于载人航空器。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:29
#: 8b00c4c8b1db4cfa991a244210501576
msgid "Our Standards"
msgstr "我们的标准"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:31
#: 74854b45839b4d0687e390278f4c52d8
msgid ""
"Examples of behavior that contributes to achieving the aims of ArduPilot "
"include:"
msgstr "有助于实现 ArduPilot 目标的行为示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:33
#: e949c9a73eed4c079c26474763fba0d0
msgid "Using welcoming and inclusive language"
msgstr "使用友好包容的语言"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:34
#: 3b7c2ecf3ac8457ea5a724ef7875423b
msgid "Being respectful of differing viewpoints and experiences"
msgstr "尊重不同观点和经历"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:35
#: 9b8f8e0ee58e471ea3ebe89ee757e583
msgid "Gracefully accepting constructive criticism"
msgstr "坦然接受建设性批评"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:36
#: d9a4f7060f9641669972cbda579afd30
msgid "Focusing on what is best for the community"
msgstr "专注于对社区最有益的事情"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:37
#: e78a7c9d22ad49c7849352206a54ccba
msgid "Showing empathy towards other community members"
msgstr "对其他社区成员展现同理心"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:39
#: d20d667c244e4a7597787139fae769a2
msgid "Examples of unacceptable behavior by contributors include:"
msgstr "贡献者不可接受的行为示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:41
#: 31cc77702e3e4a8883d208d38bb3b729
msgid ""
"The use of sexualized language or imagery and unwelcome sexual attention or "
"advances"
msgstr "使用性化语言或图像，以及不受欢迎的性关注或性骚扰"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:42
#: 68fbcca6addb43e4bb761501eb4ea217
msgid ""
"Trolling, insulting/derogatory comments, and personal or political attacks"
msgstr "恶意挑衅、侮辱/贬低性评论及个人或政治攻击"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:43
#: 93aa090b57d04ce090ac9ed6d3a47075
msgid "Public or private harassment"
msgstr "公开或私下骚扰"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:44
#: 3c2b8d118c884d0ebcce86e67a45fb0d
msgid ""
"Publishing others’ private information, such as a physical or electronic "
"address, without explicit permission"
msgstr "未经明确许可发布他人私人信息，如实际地址或电子地址"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:45
#: d48eafcfe9e745378869ddea9187c586
msgid "Modifying ArduPilot code to intentionally support weaponization"
msgstr "故意修改 ArduPilot 代码以支持武器化"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:46
#: a178e75dcd514d54a8c6d5c817073e94
msgid ""
"Knowingly designing, testing or using weaponized systems running ArduPilot"
msgstr "故意设计、测试或使用运行 ArduPilot 的武器化系统"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:47
#: dd5274e703d6454d872987ce083fc229
msgid ""
"Other conduct which could reasonably be considered inappropriate in a public"
" or professional setting"
msgstr "在公共或专业场合中可被合理认定为不当的其他行为"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:50
#: a946ea473b23486b88f8432f68f9530d
msgid "Our Responsibilities"
msgstr "我们的责任"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:52
#: 28d7232796ca4915a59e2051d827b9f2
msgid ""
"Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying the standards of "
"acceptable behavior and are expected to take appropriate and fair corrective"
" action in response to any instances of unacceptable behavior."
msgstr "项目维护者负责阐明可接受行为的标准，并应对任何不可接受的行为采取适当、公正的纠正措施。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:54
#: 7598d544c56f485db98ec287d4d799a8
msgid ""
"Project maintainers have the right and responsibility to remove, edit, or "
"reject comments, commits, code, wiki edits, issues, and other contributions "
"that are not aligned to this Code of Conduct, or to ban temporarily or "
"permanently any contributor for other behaviors that they deem "
"inappropriate, threatening, offensive, or harmful."
msgstr ""
"项目维护者有权利和责任删除、编辑或拒绝不符合本行为准则的评论、commit、代码、Wiki 编辑、issue "
"及其他贡献，或对其认为不当、威胁性、冒犯性或有害的其他行为的贡献者实施临时或永久封禁。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:57
#: b153739ee3c6495db67e910238f04811
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "适用范围"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:59
#: 2fe95e2ae99e42ff8afb5e92b188d16b
msgid ""
"This Code of Conduct applies both within project spaces and in public spaces"
" when an individual is representing the ArduPilot project or its community. "
"Examples of representing the ArduPilot project or community include using an"
" official project e-mail address, posting via an official social media "
"account, or acting as an appointed representative at an online or offline "
"event. Representation of the ArduPilot project may be further defined and "
"clarified by project maintainers."
msgstr ""
"本行为准则适用于项目空间内部，以及个人代表 ArduPilot 项目或其社区在公共空间中的行为。代表 ArduPilot "
"项目或社区的示例包括使用官方项目电子邮件地址、通过官方社交媒体账号发帖，或在线上或线下活动中担任指定代表。ArduPilot "
"项目的代表资格可由项目维护者进一步定义和说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:61
#: 10d04e235f0d4a809b94fa87f477f13a
msgid ""
"In addition, the rules regarding weaponization and manned vehicles using "
"ArduPilot apply regardless of whether you are representing the ArduPilot "
"project at the time."
msgstr "此外，关于 ArduPilot 武器化和载人飞行器使用的规则，无论您当时是否代表 ArduPilot 项目，均须遵守。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:64
#: 010ca3762745417fafcb7885619cf1b3
msgid "Enforcement"
msgstr "执行"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:65
#: 821b52bc468840f9b15628d943ab713b
msgid ""
"Instances of abusive, harassing, or otherwise unacceptable behavior, and "
"other actions not consistent with this Code of Conduct may be reported by "
"contacting the project team at ardupilot.devel@gmail.com. All complaints "
"will be reviewed and investigated and will result in a response that is "
"deemed necessary and appropriate to the circumstances. The project team is "
"obligated to maintain confidentiality with regard to the reporter of an "
"incident. Further details of specific enforcement policies may be posted "
"separately. Project maintainers who do not follow or enforce the Code of "
"Conduct in good faith may face temporary or permanent repercussions as "
"determined by other members of the project’s leadership team."
msgstr ""
"滥用、骚扰或其他不可接受行为的情况，以及与本行为准则不符的其他行为，可通过联系项目团队（ardupilot.devel@gmail.com）进行举报。所有投诉都将经过审查和调查，并将作出视情况认为必要和适当的回应。项目团队有义务对事件举报人保密。具体执行政策的更多细节可能会单独发布。不诚信地遵守或执行行为准则的项目维护者，可能会面临由项目领导团队其他成员决定的临时或永久性后果。"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:69
#: b98054f0987a453797a9fa5f68aac825
msgid "Attribution"
msgstr "归因说明"

#: ../../source/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.rst:70
#: d8a4c5f0470148ce8b1510dbf3935189
msgid ""
"This Code of Conduct is adapted from the Contributor Covenant, version 1.4, "
"available at https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/1/4/code-of-"
"conduct.html"
msgstr ""
"本行为准则改编自贡献者公约 1.4 版，详见 https://www.contributor-"
"covenant.org/version/1/4/code-of-conduct.html"
